Thought: The mass spectrum shows a molecular ion peak at m/z 199 with a characteristic isotope pattern. The presence of two major peaks at m/z 199 and 201 with almost equal intensities (100:97.6) suggests the presence of a bromine atom in the molecule (due to Br-79 and Br-81 isotopes). Let me check the IR spectrum for functional group information.
Action: ir_spectra
